
"smart_sources:2026-06-09 - ‘You do not own the airspace above your property’_ Idaho Power drone shot near Cascade.md": {"path":"2026-06-09 - ‘You do not own the airspace above your property’_ Idaho Power drone shot near Cascade.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1g810tc","at":1785795033169},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1783541251534,"size":5127,"at":1785795033222,"hash":"1g810tc"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"#":[10,37],"##More drone inspections planned in Valley County":[38,64],"##More drone inspections planned in Valley County#{1}":[40,64]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor","target":"Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor","line":5},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":20,"embedded":true},{"title":"Valley Lookout house - Drew","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/12c5b6ba-e344-4f74-a83b-fe4af9ea9df5.gif","line":30,"embedded":true},{"title":"under Idaho law","target":"https://legislature.idaho.gov/statutesrules/idstat/title18/t18ch70/sect18-7001/","line":34},{"title":"Western States - Lookout creative - 4:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/115c0cfa-e547-4a5c-8f4e-7ea7e16f8bde.png","line":46,"embedded":true},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":56,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"‘You do not own the airspace above your property’: Idaho Power drone shot near Cascade","source":"https://valleylookout.com/2026/06/09/you-do-not-own-the-airspace-above-your-property-idaho-power-drone-shot-near-cascade/","author":["[[Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor]]"],"published":"2026-06-09","created":"2026-07-08","description":"A drone inspecting power lines last weekend near Cascade was damaged after being struck by a shotgun blast, according to the Valley County Sheriff’s Office.  The incident occurred shortly after 5 p.m. on June 6 while the pilot of the drone — a contractor hired by Idaho Power — was flying around power lines along […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},